id=redmagic10pro_udc_fix
name=RedMagic 10 Pro GSI UDC Selfie Fix
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=SEQUENCODE
description=Turns the display pixels above the under-display camera off while a front camera is in use, which the Nubia firmware does on stock and a GSI does not. A bundled system app watches the camera service and places a black patch over the lens, on the lock screen too, so face unlock is covered. Position is calibrated in the app against a live preview. Aborts silently on other devices.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sequencode/redmagic-10-pro-udc-fix/master/update.json
